  message: "Folded into WI-valav-jopub (owner delegated the decision, 2026-09-30): same mechanism -- a Django related manager / QuerySet reached through a @property is invisible to DjangoRelationIndex. WI-valav (P2) carries the measured value and the current premise check; this item's second instance (OrderPosition.checkins and its call sites), its proposed property-getter-return mechanism and its sizing ask were copied onto WI-valav's discussion. Closed wont_do as a duplicate, per the tracker's convention for folds; no work was done here."  # f8cb
